        BE8->>DB: expected price differs → [tx rollback]
        BE8-->>BE1: StalePrice
        BE1-->>FE13: 409 /problems/stale-price
        FE14-->>Provider: #quot;Dr. Sam Lee changed this price to $36.00 a moment ago. Check it before saving yours.#quot;
